== ask_more
npc: Scouting. Bandits have been raiding the trade road east of here — best you keep your wits about you.
* [check Perception] [hidden] [silent] (size him up)
    success -> perception_success
    failure -> perception_failure
* Safe travels.
    -> end


== dismissive_end
npc: Suit yourself.


== end
npc: Safe travels.


== greeting
npc: You there — this road isn't safe alone. What do you want?
* [silent] What are you doing out here?
    -> ask_more
* [Chaotic] I don't have time for this.
    -> dismissive_end
* [Light] [check Persuasion] Let me travel with you — I can help.
    success -> persuade_success
    failure -> persuade_failure


== perception_failure
npc: Just be careful out there.
-> end


== perception_success
npc: ...You've got sharp eyes. Yes, I'm out here for more than scouting — there's a bounty on one of those bandits, and I mean to collect it.
-> end


== persuade_failure
npc: Not a chance. I travel alone.
-> end


== persuade_success
npc: ...Fine. You've got an honest face. Stay close and don't slow me down.
-> end
